{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act44side_level_act44side_07_end",
  "groupId": "act44side",
  "stageId": "act44side_07",
  "title": "冷月",
  "storyCode": "AT-7",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act44side/level_act44side_07_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "ca7c9337df4f8b6b94f405e29c2f9c2a87cbeceafcd1a7545a9110002b41d7d9",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_warehouse_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "電視台的所有人全都亂成一團了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吉星",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1897_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "天啊……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吉星",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1897_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奶奶以前跟我說過，在她年輕的時候，真的有北院的滲透部隊曾進入御機……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吉星",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1897_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我聽的時候不覺得有什麼，但現在看來，我們面前的場面只是小意思，萬一……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "更紗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1900_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼樣？我送給金兵衛的這份大禮怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吉星",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1897_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "效果可能有點……好過頭了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "更紗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1900_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還是專心想我們自己的事吧。森內老闆已經混進了電視台，我們也該趁機前往繼位儀式現場了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "更紗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1900_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這個時候那裡應該沒什麼人。如果還有抵抗，吉星，你也得幫忙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吉星",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1897_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "瞭解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "更紗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1900_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那現在就出發吧！我來帶路，從這個通風口爬上去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "更紗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1900_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們也快點上來啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "來、來了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好、好高……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "更紗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1900_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別怕，萌萌香，我這裡有燈。手給我，我牽著你走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "萌萌香努力控制自己不要往下看，但她的身體依然止不住地顫抖搖晃。\n此刻，她們在密密麻麻的鋼筋結構之間緩緩移動，頭頂一片昏暗，腳下亮如白晝。\n電視台的員工、黑道、忍者，亂成一團的人們就在她們的正下方來來去去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "更紗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1900_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "吉星，你怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吉星",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1897_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還、還好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "更紗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1900_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就好啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "更紗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1900_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們很少來這種地方嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吉星",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1897_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "誰會每天在這種地方跑來跑去啦！難道你是什麼叛逃的忍者嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "更紗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1900_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那倒不是。我都是為了躲忍者，才習慣在這種地方走路的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "躲忍者？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "更紗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1900_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，那不重要——我們到了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "更紗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1900_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘖，下面還有幾個人看著……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "更紗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1900_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萌萌香，從這邊的空隙跳過去，順著那邊的管道下去舞台，那邊是他們的視線死角。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這麼長的距離？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我、我試試看……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "萌萌香緊握雙拳，目光直盯著正前方，左腳往後蹬地——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "原本靜止的鋼筋結構突然開始運轉起來，萌萌香腳下的平台同時不規則地震動著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "更紗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1900_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……怎麼突然就動起來了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我、我好像要滑下去了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吉星",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1897_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小心頭頂！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "怎麼回事……\n哇！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吉星",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1897_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "掉下去了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吉星",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1897_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不管那麼多了，更紗，我們也下去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吉星",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1897_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呀——哦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "64_g12_stage"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "更紗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1900_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萌萌香，你沒事吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還好！我還撐得住！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "更紗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1900_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，你快點上去舞台，我去操作台控制線路！燈光一亮你就開始！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吉星",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1897_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等不及要聽萌萌香開嗓了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那可能不太行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "澪……小姐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……萌萌香。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是來阻止我的，對嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為了金石會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我大概知道你會說什麼。那會毀掉整個金石會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "監視的忍者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1916_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "澪小姐，急報，星熊已經殺到電視台門口了。按照三船先生的指令，您該往那邊過去了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "星熊是為了她才出現在這裡的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "監視的忍者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1916_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是三船先生——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "另一個監視我的人，請你去告訴三船先生，星熊一定會來，我會在這裡等她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在，萌萌香、吉星小姐，還有我不知道名字的，躲在控制台那邊的小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "直到星熊抵達之前，我建議你們不要輕舉妄動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "三船先生和金石會的確有許多對不起你們的地方，但這裡是我，還有其他一些人的容身之處。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不能放任你們毀了它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吉星",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1897_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不要聽她嚇人！萌萌香——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "黑色的鬼手忽然出現在吉星的脖頸之前，吉星下意識地往後退了一步，扣動扳機。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "鬼手直接撕開鋼珠形狀的榴彈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "燈突然關了。整個舞台暗了下來，只有微弱的光從控制面板的方向傳來。\n澪一手持短刀，一手持長刀，往有光的方向走去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "更紗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1900_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對，我在這裡……過來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_light"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "天花板上的燈突然亮了一盞，直射澪的眼睛，然後又是一盞，又是一盞，又是一盞——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "64_g12_stage"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "又全數同時熄滅。\n但澪的猶豫也只持續了一瞬。她稍微鎮定了一下，直撲控制台而去——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "啪！\n一盞射燈險些砸中澪的頭頂，被澪側身閃開。再看控制台時，那裡已經沒人了。\n趁澪操作控制台的空檔，吉星、萌萌香、更紗，所有人都開始往舞台側邊出入口的方向狂奔而去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "更紗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1900_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "門被她鎖上了！我們換個門——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "喀噠，喀噠，喀噠。\n落鎖聲在幾人周圍迴盪……\n連頭頂的燈也重新亮了起來。\n澪緩緩走向下意識聚成一堆的三人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "燈現在不歸你們管。不要再抵抗了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "更紗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1900_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……歸我管。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "更紗緊閉雙眼，舉起手中似燈非燈的長杖。\n澪的腳步陡然加快。\n就在這時，長杖一端忽然發出明亮如白晝的強光，整個舞台上方的燈光再度熄滅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "不只是燈光，整個舞台殘存的光全部被困在了杖尖那團跳動的液體之中——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "更紗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1900_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "冰山美人，要關燈囉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "——而後被吞噬殆盡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "64_g12_stage"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "更紗？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "更紗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我……我睡一下……好累……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小聲）現、現在怎麼辦？我聽見澪小姐的腳步聲了！她在往我們這邊過來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小聲）我們先往另一邊的舞台出口過去吧，萬一那邊的門沒鎖……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吉星",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1897_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小聲）不行，太遠了，她會發現我們的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吉星",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1897_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小聲）我們剛剛掉下來的地方不就是這裡嗎？能不能原路返回？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小聲）通風口——"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "吉星背起更紗剛要邁步，澪的說話聲就在舞台中央響起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別白費心思。我聽得到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼辦？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吉星",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1897_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只能拼了。我去對付她——"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "與此同時，她身後忽然傳來叩擊聲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "鎖了嗎？那我就不客氣了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "門口的人，讓開！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一聲巨響過後，緊鎖的大門帶著門外的光豁然洞開。\n下一個瞬間，像是受到了門外透進來的光芒的呼喚一樣，一個一個明亮的光球從更紗的杖中緩緩飄浮起來，悠然回到了它們來的地方——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……更紗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "更紗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1900_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還以為可以多睡一下呢……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "更紗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1900_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要我還在睡，這裡就別想再亮起來……"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "更紗打了個哈欠，連帶著頭頂的燈光也跟著閃動。\n見澪沒有動，更紗往控制台的方向走去。\n她已經走了不遠的一段，連萌萌香也試探著跟上了她，澪仍然站在原地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不去阻止她們嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不去，你的刀已經出鞘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對付她們，不是我的工作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就憑在你之後趕來的那些烏合之眾，恐怕還過不了吉星和更紗那關。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如若真是如此，我也無可奈何。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "三船呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不關心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們之間的這場戰鬥，與他無關。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "49_g13_smallroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "勤務指揮中心",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1914_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "惟任先生，最後一家電視台的線路也恢復正常了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1898_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "知道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "勤務指揮中心",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1914_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現場指揮問您花火大會怎麼辦。經過剛才的意外，民眾都有些驚魂未定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1898_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "會不會有踩踏一類嚴重事件發生的風險？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "勤務指揮中心",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1914_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很低，和預想情況沒有太大差別。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1898_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就繼續舉辦。三船喜歡熱鬧，我們就幫他熱鬧到底。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "勤務指揮中心",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1914_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "同時還不停有民眾打電話進來，問剛剛的事情到底是怎麼回事，您看……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1898_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看？我能怎麼看？告訴民眾，警察正在調查當中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1898_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然，關於為什麼誤播的訊號是北院入侵的緊急警報，這一點的責任全在金石電視台，警方會嚴肅處理——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "值班警察",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1898_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "惟任先生，有人來了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1898_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "誰？三船光平？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的訪客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "惟任先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1898_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然不是三船，我還以為會是那位一直對他關愛有加的議員先生親自來訪呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的訪客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "捕風捉影對您的職業生涯沒有好處，而且您未免太高估自己了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1898_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，這算是承認了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的訪客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的訪客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的確是來警告您的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的訪客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今夜在仁田街發生的混亂，警察方面已經難辭其咎。我們希望這樣的混亂不要繼續擴大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1898_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "難辭其咎？我好怕啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的訪客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放尊重點。您不是沒有平安了結此事的機會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1898_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我倒要向您請教一下了，請問我應該怎麼辦呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的訪客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "中止今晚舉辦的所有活動，集中警力控制金石電視台，搜捕與事件相關的人員。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1898_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪幾位？我記一下。三船光平肯定是頭號嫌疑人吧？他的電視台竟然敢隨便放那種東西——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的訪客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的人無權動他——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1898_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就一切免談。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的訪客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然您不願服從命令，就在這份免職通知上簽名，然後就可以走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的訪客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果對內容有什麼問題，請儘管諮詢您的上級。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1898_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哇哦，我現在還有回頭的餘地嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的訪客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "已經晚了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1898_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，你說的沒錯，已經晚了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "說著，刑警伸出腳尖……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的訪客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "……把來客輕輕勾倒在地，然後從他手裡接過那張簽著自己上司大名的紙，緩緩撕成碎片。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1898_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還以為議員大人的秘書有個兩把刷子呢，怎麼一碰就倒了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的訪客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1898_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你……你敢？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1898_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "回去告訴你們那個議員，警察保護的是他那條爛命，不是他的爛錢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1898_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果他真的覺得有人想要他的命，讓他自己來報案，我們會考慮受理的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1898_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在，給我滾出這間警察局！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "64_g12_stage"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "白色的長刀，黑色的手套，白色的裸手，黑色的長刀，白色的短刀，黑色的鬼手——\n黑白之間的輪轉令人目眩。黎博利揮刀的招數與她給人的印象全然相反，沒有回，只有去，沒有防守，只有試探和搶攻。\n獨角的鬼卻樸素許多。閃避、格擋、後退、騰挪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一十二刀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你剛剛一口氣擋下一十二刀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼不反擊？你仍在害怕你手裡的刀？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那它一開始就不會出鞘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "倒是你，看起來斯斯文文，打起架來兇狠至極。金兵衛的刀可不是這路數。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的刀與他無關。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你為什麼為他賣命？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我何曾為他賣命？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別自欺欺人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "星熊緩緩環顧四周。\n吉星的榴彈在各處爆響，而舞台裝置幾乎成了由更紗使役的巨大怪物。\n再加上四處躲藏的萌萌香，局勢不僅撐得下去，甚至還略有餘裕。\n此時此刻，當初制定的作戰計劃就只差最後一環……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我要保護的東西，只有金石會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在你眼裡，只有金兵衛的金石會，才是金石會嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能讓為人所不容的敗類們活下去，這才是金石會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "鐵齋不能讓你活下去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再這樣繼續擋下去——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你終究會露出破綻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "64_g12_stage"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……你終於出手了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也只是割破了你衣服的下襬而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你周身纏繞著藍色的火焰。那是你的源石技藝嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "藍色的火焰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還真的是。我沒注意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "比起那個，告訴我，為什麼鐵齋不能讓你活下去，金兵衛卻可以？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因為鐵齋甚至沒辦法保護他自己——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "64_g12_stage"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "星熊簡簡單單地刺出一刀，那刀上纏繞著的火焰卻逼得澪向後躍了一大步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不太想聽這個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……你身上的火焰，燒得更旺了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "告訴我，為什麼鐵齋不能讓你活下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因為鐵齋沒辦法保護他自己。御機不需要他，不需要鐵齋手下的澪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一個衣衫襤褸還一言不發，只在別人欺負到自己頭上時以命相搏的孤兒，是禍害。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一個盛裝見人卻沉默寡言，只在公司利益受損時揮刀砍人的助理，是讓人憧憬的高嶺之花。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我先前還以為你是什麼家道中落的武家千金。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "鐵齋想給我們這些社會敗類一個家，所以他死了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "三船知道我們根本不配有一個家，所以，他活到了今天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這就是御機對金石會的定論？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一向如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "星熊周身青藍色的烈火幾乎要將她完全包裹其中。\n黎博利忽然覺得，在吞噬自己之前，那火焰會先將眼前的鬼焚盡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……你很憤怒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "二十年前，你也像這樣憤怒嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這很重要嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "三船先生希望你像二十年前一樣失去理智。他覺得這樣你就會變成人人得而誅之的狂獸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你知道他想這麼做，所以，你在壓抑自己，就像上次你不願拔刀出鞘一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在邀請我對憤怒聽之任之？完成你主人的任務？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不想這樣。但如果你真的這麼做了，我也並不介意。我只是覺得可惜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有什麼好可惜的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一個完美的敵手，卻永遠不能以完整的姿態站在我的面前，要嘛壓抑，要嘛失控。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但也就這樣了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "接招。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "澪再度對星熊舉刀。\n三隻手，三把刀。看似雜亂無章的架勢，只等在進攻中逼出那個破綻——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "接著！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "誰？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森內",
      "speakerId": "avg_4199_makiri_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這個東西……太重了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森內",
      "speakerId": "avg_4199_makiri_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就算電視台裡一團亂，把它從金兵衛的房間裡偷出來也差點讓我累死……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森內",
      "speakerId": "avg_4199_makiri_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……接著！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "森內擺動著身體，用力將巨大的般若拋向對峙的兩人。\n澪的鬼手先一步抓住了般若的把手，但星熊高高躍起，近乎舞步般轉了半個圈，甩開鬼手，將般若的把手握在手中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要嘛壓抑，要嘛失控？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，我不會失控的。有般若不會，沒有般若，也不會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "說著，星熊輕輕握了握刀上的綁帶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過般若畢竟也是在一起很久的夥伴了，如果剛才你還有三成的勝率……現在，你不可能是我的對手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "怒火。\n剛剛彷彿壓縮在星熊周身的怒火瞬間延燒開來，在她的雙臂、在她手中的盾和刀上燃燒。\n星熊往前踏出一步，怒火幾乎要順著地面燎到澪衣服的下襬。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那很好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不會失控，對我而言已經足夠了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "星熊對面，黑色，白色，人手，鬼手，長刀，短刀。\n黎博利並未有半分怯意。她的嘴角甚至勾起一個難以察覺的弧度。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有什麼沒說完的話嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對金石會好一點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對萌萌香好一點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唯獨對萌萌香，我做不到問心無愧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我記住了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "金兵衛呢？關於他，你就沒有什麼要交代的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他？此時此刻，我們有聊他的必要嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "星熊隨意地換了一個便於出力的站姿，青色的火在她周圍時斷時續地燒著。\n盾面上的般若之面瞪大雙眼，而那把刀身的亂紋邊緣，下一刻就要滲出青色的血淚——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喝啊！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "64_g12_stage"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這就是……般若？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊，這就是般若。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的刀配得上你的刀法。被般若捲入，最終也不過是被甩飛了出去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你儘管把它們撿回來，我們接著繼續打。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……不用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我已經明白了你的實力究竟如何，再和你對抗，沒有任何意義。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我必須提早做準備。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "準備什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "善後。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為一個沒有三船先生的金石會善後。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "森內，萌萌香那邊怎麼樣了，準備好了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森內",
      "speakerId": "avg_4199_makiri_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就等你這邊打完了。更紗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "更紗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1900_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "瞭解！萌萌香？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "萌萌香站在舞台中央，聚光燈已經全數打在她身上。\n吉星已經儘量把她附近清空，但她腳邊還是不可避免地躺了幾個倒地的黑道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我……我隨時可以開始！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "更紗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1900_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "更紗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1900_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "金石電視台今晚最重磅的節目，就要開始了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
